################################################################################
# OpenEvolve BubbleLab Integration - Environment Variable Template
# =============================================================================
# This template contains ALL 272 configurable parameters for the OpenEvolve
# BubbleLab integration.
#
# IMPORTANT INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to .env and fill in actual values
# 2. NEVER commit .env file to version control
# 3. REQUIRED values must be provided or the application will fail to start
# 4. Following the LAW OF CONFIGURATION EXPLICITNESS - no magic defaults
# 5. All values must be explicitly configured per environment
